# Copy to .env.local and fill in. See README.md → "Wiring up the form".

# --- Enquiry modal — set ONE ---------------------------------------------

# Option A (recommended): Web3Forms. Enter your delivery address once at
# https://web3forms.com and paste the access key here. The address itself never
# appears in the page source. Free for 250 submissions/month.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Option B: FormSubmit — no signup at all, enquiries are emailed here. The very
# first submission triggers a one-time activation email; click the link in it
# and the form is live. Note the address ships in the client bundle, where
# scrapers can read it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_EMAIL=sales@rosadori.com

# Web3Forms wins if both are set. With neither, the modal shows the studio's
# email and phone instead of a form, so an unconfigured deploy never swallows
# an enquiry.
